{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Machine warrior Ego awakens in a bombed out future filled with killer machines, strange alien landscapes, and mysteries around every corner. Now he stands as the only barrier between the last bastion of Haven and complete annihilation for humankind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vast imaginative world filled with hundreds of secrets and collectibles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle a vast array of devastating bosses and enemies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather powerful upgrades to enhance your strength and ability to move around (and even speak to some of your sentient Augment upgrades). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the town of Haven and interact with its denizens as you gain new ways to upgrade and build onto your newfound home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And above all, become the hero that humanity desperately needs as you discover the true meaning of the ancient and mysterious Anthem in this new dark sci fi epic platformer!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3035960?t=1757872473","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035960/e783cd9db18dd462416ad1e4fb27780a23eb9e3b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757872473","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035960/d428890cf7144942bdebac258683a0ae334971f0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757872473","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035960/d428890cf7144942bdebac258683a0ae334971f0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757872473","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Machine warrior Ego awakens in a bombed out future filled with killer machines, strange alien landscapes, and mysteries around every corner. Now he stands as the only barrier between the last bastion of Haven and complete annihilation for humankind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vast imaginative world filled with hundreds of secrets and collectibles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle a vast array of devastating bosses and enemies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather powerful upgrades to enhance your strength and ability to move around (and even speak to some of your sentient Augment upgrades). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the town of Haven and interact with its denizens as you gain new ways to upgrade and build onto your newfound home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And above all, become the hero that humanity desperately needs as you discover the true meaning of the ancient and mysterious Anthem in this new dark sci fi epic platformer!</p>","developers":["Project Ego"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035960/043c808c04cf84fac2e5fc7d287a74d728a8541a/header.jpg?t=1757872473","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3035960/654885523/173a9e331048f24a051e1156d387b2e08a7ad09b/1757678853/dash_av1.mpd?t=1757679995","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3035960/654885523/173a9e331048f24a051e1156d387b2e08a7ad09b/1757678853/dash_h264.mpd?t=1757679995","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3035960/654885523/173a9e331048f24a051e1156d387b2e08a7ad09b/1757678853/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1757679995","id":257196753,"name":"Early Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257196753/53cc894d4e9a5